{"type":"text","timestamp":1794545873172,"sessionID":"ses_e2cbe0c22ffeTFkKaq2FPcs2LC","part":{"id":"prt_1d344e3c6001zWG4jhMu8gZEWo","sessionID":"ses_e2cbe0c22ffeTFkKaq2FPcs2LC","messageID":"msg_1d344daea0010Ssq0woOrrj810","type":"text","text":"T004 is done.\n\n**Files written**\n- `.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/pi.mjs` — added `injectedFromLines(lines)`, which collects each `custom_message` entry's `contentText(line.content)` as `{ source: line.customType ?? 'custom_message', text }` when non-empty, and wired `injected: injectedFromLines(entries)` (live) and `injected: injectedFromLines(lines)` (disk) after `records`.\n- `.skilled/hooks/shared/tests/session-readers/pi.test.mjs` — added the `BRIEF` fixture head and one case appending `{ type: 'custom_message', customType: 'session-start-context', id: 'pi-context', content: BRIEF }` to a disk fixture, asserting `injected` equals `[{ source: 'session-start-context', text: BRIEF }]` through `loadPiSession` and that no record has id `pi-context`.\n\n**Verify output**\n```\n✔ the project folder name matches the one Pi writes (0.542166ms)\n✔ an older session resolves by header id and matching cwd (2.539708ms)\n✔ the current session resolves from the live branch without a disk read (0.140375ms)\n✔ a project-key collision is rejected by the header cwd (1.789241ms)\n✔ two session files with one id are refused as session_ambiguous (1.73475ms)\n✔ an absent id is a session_not_found even when a newer session exists (1.429667ms)\n✔ a missing store is a store_unreadable (0.63775ms)\n✔ a custom_message entry is injected context, not a turn (1.416542ms)\nℹ tests 8\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 8\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\n```\n`node --check` on `pi.mjs` exits 0, and the test command exits 0. `git status` lists only the two named files. I did not tick the checkbox, and I found nothing I could not do.","time":{"start":1794545869766,"end":1794545873172}}}
